# Size Count Type

A named kind of count for size. In software this could be lines of code for a specific language.

◇

attributes:
    - key: name
      name: Name
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
    - key: description
      name: Description
      rules: unconstrained
      nullable: true
      type_spec: STRING

associations:
    - name: Has Size Categories
      details: Ordered categories of this size count.
      from_multiplicity: "1"
      to_class_key: size_category
      to_multiplicity: any
      uniqueness:
          - to_attributes:
                - num
          - to_attributes:
                - name
